[
  {
    "_comment": "CDC scenario KEYS: PostgreSQL CDC over logical decoding (wal2json) of the domain's own replication slot (created with the domain, named after it, reused by the publisher); every model table REPLICA IDENTITY FULL, so the two keyless tables log their updates and deletes with whole before-images. wal2json carries the rows an ON DELETE CASCADE takes and an UPDATE that sets the values a row has: --cascades logged --noops logged. Every way a row is identified, over four variants of the publisher (functions/caps_postgrescdc.py), each in its own collection: postgrescdc_in (start_from=tail, flattened rows), postgrescdc_head (start_from=head), postgrescdc_struct (columns_format=struct, flatten_columns=False), postgrescdc_map (columns_format=map). STAGES: (1) domains -- create the postgrescdc domain, install employeescdc, load the xs seed; (2) collections and (3) functions -- registering a stream publisher STARTS it; (4) sentinel -- hold until postgrescdc_in and postgrescdc_head have attached (a change before that is not theirs to see): a probe writes `sentinel-data --key attached-<n>-<random>` every 20s, at most 20m, until one arrives in each; (5) actions, tagged live -- one `modify-data --ops Mix --sets 30` pass (inserts, updates -- accounts' moving its key, ledger's by both columns of its key, devices' by its unique index, readings' by every column -- and deletes), then `sentinel-data --key after-changes`; (6) sentinel -- hold until after-changes is in postgrescdc_in and postgrescdc_head; (7) actions, tagged check -- scripts/verify_cdc_ops.py checks postgrescdc_in from the tail and postgrescdc_head as a tail too: each variant creates its own slot when it registers, and logical decoding keeps no WAL from before a slot, so its head is where it attached, one change at a time with its whole before-image and the row it leaves, nothing of audit (each its own lane: one failing does not hide the other); postgrescdc_struct and postgrescdc_map run over the same changes, unchecked: their rows nest the values the check reads flat; (8) monitor. Generated by gen_suites.py. Run: `tdd xp one-shot --suite cdc/postgrescdc_keys --keep`."
  },
  {
    "domain-manifest": {
      "emit_ops": "${xp:dir}/ops.jsonl",
      "domains": [
        {
          "name": "${xp:name(employeescdc_xs)}",
          "system": "postgrescdc",
          "model": "employeescdc",
          "size": 1
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "collections": [
      {
        "name": "postgrescdc_in",
        "type": "postgres_cdc",
        "connection_template": "connection-file:connections/postgres_cdc.yaml",
        "group": "sources",
        "domains": {
          "D0": "${xp:name(employeescdc_xs)}"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "postgrescdc_head",
        "type": "postgres_cdc",
        "connection_template": "connection-file:connections/postgres_cdc.yaml",
        "group": "sources",
        "domains": {
          "D0": "${xp:name(employeescdc_xs)}"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "postgrescdc_struct",
        "type": "postgres_cdc",
        "connection_template": "connection-file:connections/postgres_cdc.yaml",
        "group": "sources",
        "domains": {
          "D0": "${xp:name(employeescdc_xs)}"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "postgrescdc_map",
        "type": "postgres_cdc",
        "connection_template": "connection-file:connections/postgres_cdc.yaml",
        "group": "sources",
        "domains": {
          "D0": "${xp:name(employeescdc_xs)}"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "functions": [
      {
        "collection": "postgrescdc_in",
        "functionpath": "functions/caps_postgrescdc.py::postgrescdc_in"
      },
      {
        "collection": "postgrescdc_head",
        "functionpath": "functions/caps_postgrescdc.py::postgrescdc_in_head"
      },
      {
        "collection": "postgrescdc_struct",
        "functionpath": "functions/caps_postgrescdc.py::postgrescdc_in_struct"
      },
      {
        "collection": "postgrescdc_map",
        "functionpath": "functions/caps_postgrescdc.py::postgrescdc_in_map"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "sentinel": [
      {
        "collection": "postgrescdc_in",
        "table": "xp_sentinel_changes",
        "wait_for_key": "attached",
        "time_out": "20m",
        "probe": {
          "domain": "${xp:name(employeescdc_xs)}",
          "every": "20s",
          "emit_ops": "${xp:dir}/ops.jsonl"
        }
      },
      {
        "collection": "postgrescdc_head",
        "table": "xp_sentinel_changes",
        "wait_for_key": "attached",
        "time_out": "20m",
        "probe": {
          "domain": "${xp:name(employeescdc_xs)}",
          "every": "20s",
          "emit_ops": "${xp:dir}/ops.jsonl"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "actions": [
      {
        "tdd": {
          "name": "change",
          "tags": [
            "live"
          ],
          "tool": "domain",
          "command": "modify-data",
          "options": [
            "--domain",
            "${xp:name(employeescdc_xs)}",
            "--ops",
            "Mix",
            "--sets",
            "30",
            "--emit-ops",
            "${xp:dir}/ops.jsonl"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "tdd": {
          "name": "sentinel-changed",
          "tags": [
            "live"
          ],
          "tool": "domain",
          "command": "sentinel-data",
          "options": [
            "--domain",
            "${xp:name(employeescdc_xs)}",
            "--key",
            "after-changes",
            "--emit-ops",
            "${xp:dir}/ops.jsonl"
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "sentinel": [
      {
        "collection": "postgrescdc_in",
        "table": "xp_sentinel_changes",
        "wait_for_key": "after-changes",
        "time_out": "20m"
      },
      {
        "collection": "postgrescdc_head",
        "table": "xp_sentinel_changes",
        "wait_for_key": "after-changes",
        "time_out": "20m"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "actions": [
      {
        "python": {
          "name": "verify-postgrescdc_in",
          "tags": [
            "check"
          ],
          "script": "scripts/verify_cdc_ops.py",
          "params": [
            "${xp:dir}/ops.jsonl",
            "postgrescdc_in",
            "--cascades",
            "logged",
            "--noops",
            "logged",
            "--start",
            "tail",
            "--untracked",
            "audit",
            "--profile",
            "${td:profile}"
